    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d229-a8">

                <pb facs="0422" n="388" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg388"/>

                <head>G.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Her Majesty’s Steamer Salamis,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Che Foo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-08-31"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 31, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge your second
                    dispatch of this date, in which you still desire I will send a vessel to bring
                    away American missionaries from Tungchow, and in reply I beg to inform you that
                    I find her Majesty’s gunboat Grasshopper can be made ready for sea by to-morrow
                    morning, and will proceed on this service at daylight. On arrival at Tungchow
                    she will anchor off the town, hoist her ensign at the masthead, and be prepared
                    to receive any American citizens and their families, and their servants, but <hi
                        rendition="#italic">no other persons.</hi> The commander of the gunboat will
                    not land, nor send the boats on shore, and I request you will have the goodness
                    to send a dispatch to Dr. Nevins by the Grasshopper, impressing upon him the
                    urgent necessity of the embarkation taking place without delay.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HENRY KELLETT, <hi rendition="#italic">Vice-Admiral and
                            Commander-in-chief.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>S. A. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Holmes,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >United States Consul</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Che Foo.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
